# English-only UI and copy

This project uses **English only** for all user-facing content.

- UI labels, buttons, tooltips, `aria-label`, `title`, confirm dialogs, empty states
- Achievement names, descriptions, and category tab labels
- HTML `lang` attribute must be `en`
- Do not add Turkish (or other non-English) strings in code, HTML, or comments meant for users

Code comments for developers may be English; prefer clear English over Turkish.
